        "{:?}",
        b.plan
    );
    // ...and Enter counts afresh, since it acts on the disk as it is now.
    app.on_key(k(KeyCode::Enter));
    assert!(matches!(app.mode, Mode::Confirm(_)), "it asks first");
    assert!(joined(&mut app).contains("3 occurrences"));
}

